on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.0\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and thin 2.1\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.9%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 11% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.5\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"News sentiment sharply negative (-0.37) across 12 recent articles \u2014 the narrative has turned","sev":"red","cat":"news"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Trading near 52-week highs \u2014 the market has already recognised the story","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.1463212091014782},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 9.6% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Advertising-cycle exposure and content/regulatory risk \u2014 a single platform policy shift or ad-spend contraction cascades through the P&L quickly.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Cord-cutting acceleration and audience fragmentation \u2014 legacy distribution bundles unravel faster than subscription revenue can replace them.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"AI-generated content commoditisation \u2014 as creation costs collapse toward zero, content libraries lose pricing power and differentiation narrows.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"88-year-old mall retailer Dillard's closes key 50,000 sq ft store, cuts jobs","source":"aol.